<blockquote>
<p>SCP-5127's shape is complementary to an oblate spheroid.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>In mathematics, a complement is the set of elements that complete a universal set that are <em>not</em> part of the set in question, eg, an oblate spheroid.</p>
<p>I know this is a mistake, but this line implies that the shape of 5127 is all R<sup>3</sup> embedded shapes that are not an oblate spheroid, which I think is a weirdly fascinating idea.</p>

