			<div class="content" id="post-content-4855398">
									

<p>Seeking Greenlight: Yes</p>
<p>Page Type: SCP Article</p>
<p>Genre: Fiction</p>
<p>Elevator Pitch: SCP-5968 is an anomalous humanoid who has a strange immunity to the effects of some of the foundation’s most dangerous SCP’s and has shown the ability of nullifying the anomalous properties of said SCP’s. They are not anomalous in any ways other than immunity and nullification. No super strength; no super intelligence; no super powers.</p>
<p>Central Narrative: Numerous addendums describing studies and tests involving SCP-5968’s interactions with and reactions to other SCP’s. Some data is still in progress, and the storyline for INCIDENT-5968/H is TBD.</p>
<p>Hook/Attention Grabber: SCP-5968 is both one of the most helpful, and most dangerous, anomalies at the foundation. We know how he is helpful, but what makes him so dangerous?</p>

